Test: Array destructuring
--------------------------------------
  Simple destructuring:
    a = 10 (first element)
    b = 20 (second element)

  Destructuring match() groups:
    x = 42 (first group)
    y = 99 (second group)
    matched = -x42-y99 (matched string)

  Nested destructuring:
    a = 1 b = 2
    c = 3 d = 4

  Destructuring from function call:
    first = 10
    second = 20

  Destructuring from split():
    part1 = a
    part2 = b
    part3 = c
